# Iris Flower Prediction System

## Overview

This project predicts Iris flower species using Machine Learning.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Scikit-Learn
- Flask
- Bootstrap
- Docker
- GitHub

## Features

- Flower Prediction
- Confidence Score
- Flower Image Display
- Docker Deployment

## Run Locally

python train.py

python app.py

Open:
http://127.0.0.1:5000